alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025. October to November is the driest pair at 5.11 inches normal, and it came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, September to October ran 31% of normal and October to November ran 34%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 190% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value.</p>"}
